<title>INDIA: India FII net inflows at $365.5 mln in June.</title>
<headline>India FII net inflows at $365.5 mln in June.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net investments by foreign institutional investors (FIIs) in India totalled $365.5 million in June against $198.4 million in May, an official of the Securities &amp; Exchange Board of India (SEBI) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>She told Reuters cumulative net investment by registered FIIs in India totalled $8.32 billion to date.</p>
<p>India opened its doors to foreign portfolio investments in 1993.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
